# sys-snowpoint-temple: Snowpoint Temple 1F to B5F, round its ice (the player slides
# until blocked; world `ice`, as in the Snowpoint Gym) and down each floor's stairs. A constructed start inside the
# door (the guard lets the player in after the National Dex; that gate is cp23's). The walk is a shortest path that
# models the slides (generated, then replayed as is). B5F's Regigigas is (m6-regigigas).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
set flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
date 2009-03-22 12:00
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_1F 8 12 up
until idle
+0 wild flee
# 1F → B1F.
+0 press right
until position 12 12 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 12 5 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 14 5 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 14 3 300
+0 release up
+0 press left
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B1F" 300
+0 release left
until idle 600
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B1F
# B1F → B2F.
+0 press down
until position 4 12 300
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 9 12 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 9 11 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 14 11 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 14 3 300
+0 release up
+0 press left
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B2F" 300
+0 release left
until idle 600
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B2F
